#showas:适应或灭亡
Your AI adversary is a product of unnatural selection and has learned from its experiments with human and alien races alike the value of being unpredictable. Through its heartless experimentations, it has subjugated alien species and has created monstrous allies: the Scourge.

Yet, even the AI was unable to fully control its creations. A risky human expedition has freed a sect of the Scourge who has become grateful for their freedom and has sworn their revenge against the AI. 

However, the opportunistic marauders, themselves a human-Scourge prototype, have exploited the AI’s alien mishaps for themselves. They have teamed up with their own Scourge allies and have learned from the Zenith Trader how to tame the metal-hungry macrophage.

It is a wild and dangerous galaxy. Scattered Zenith and Spire energy signatures have been detected; our generals can’t agree if this helps or hurts our chances. Expect the unexpected; adapt or perish. 